# The ruling (CR 616.1, 615.6): when damage meets Lightning's doubling and a prevention shield, the damaged player orders them;
# if all of the damage is prevented, Lightning's effect no longer applies. Lightning hits Bot2 (to 17); Bot1 casts Lightning
# Bolt, and Bot2 shields itself with Healing Salve in response. Bot2 has the Salve apply first: all 3 is prevented, nothing is
# left to double, and Bot2 takes 0 (17). At the second Bolt, with a second Salve, Bot2 has Lightning's effect apply first: 3
# doubled is 6, of which 3 are prevented, so Bot2 takes 3 (14).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Lightning, Army of One
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mox Ruby
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Healing Salve
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning, Army of One.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Lightning, Army of One > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Damage]
? Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot2.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Replace(Healing Salve)
? Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot2.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Replace(Lightning, Army of One)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Prevented = 3 Lightning Bolt > Bot2 by Healing Salve; 3 Lightning Bolt > Bot2 by Healing Salve
Bot2.Graveyard = Healing Salve; Healing Salve
